const copy={
  zh:{autoPrice:'自动 · 包含墙位与现价',autoPriceNote:'自动范围至少保留快照价附近 ±15%，并扩展到已披露的现价、看涨墙和看跌墙；下方总 GEX 曲线还包含两个快照的零点。两侧增加5%留白，仅改变显示，不重算 GEX，也不补造范围外数据。',autoPriceFallback:'未取得可用的正数现价或关键价位，图表显示供应商返回的全部价格点。',distributionAutoNote:'自动包含本快照的现价与看涨／看跌墙；只扩展显示范围，未合并档位或补造数据。',distributionTitle:'各行权价的伽马分布',distributionIntro:'绿色为 Call，红色为 Put，灰色菱形为单档净值。观察墙位之外的集中区与稀疏区。',lineComparison:'蓝色实线包含所选到期日；橘黄虚线去掉了其中最先到期的一期。在相同假设股价、相同模型条件下，蓝线高于黄线表示最近一期净贡献偏正，低于则偏负。两组数据时点不同时仅作结构对照；黄线不是未来走势。',settlementAxis:'假设到期结算价',tableLimit:'表格显示前500个价格点；曲线仍使用全部返回点。',permission:'行情权限不足，或只读授权需要重新连接。',unsupported:'供应商暂不支持这项查询。',notConfigured:'moomoo 只读行情连接尚未配置。',priceRange:'图表价格范围',nearPrice:'手动 · 快照价附近 ±15%',allPrice:'全部价格',priceViewNote:'仅裁剪图表显示，不改变到期范围、不重算 GEX；墙位和零点卡片保留全部返回位置；数据表不随裁剪变化，最多显示500行。',priceViewFallback:'快照标的价格未披露，图表显示全部价格范围。',outsideView:'此显示范围内没有可用点；可切换全部价格。',tableFull:'表格保留供应商返回的全价格范围。',eyebrow:'PCR 的波动结构参考',title:'伽马敞口与最大痛苦',subtitle:'先看期限范围，再看敞口、墙位与到期结构。',selection:'选择标的',symbol:'关注标的',reloadList:'重新读取名单',manage:'管理关注名单',loadingHelp:'打开页面只读取已有快照；点击各项“更新”才会向 moomoo 检查，不刷新完整日 PCR。',gammaTitle:'伽马敞口 · 到期前后对照',gammaIntro:'比较整个所选期权组合，并单独查看各行权价的贡献。',range:'到期范围',nearest:'最近到期',seven:'未来7天 · 自然日',thirty:'未来30天 · 自然日',all:'全期限',gammaRefresh:'更新伽马',painRefresh:'更新最大痛苦',profileTitle:'总 GEX 曲线 · 不同假设股价',profileHelp:'横轴是假设标的价格，纵轴是全组合模型 GEX。曲线高于零为模型净正伽马，低于零为净负伽马；曲线不是股价预测。',barsTitle:'行权价分布 · 选择快照',base:'所选到期范围',without:'去掉最近到期日',barsHelp:'横轴是行权价，按所选快照的标的价格估值；保留各行权价的实际间距，不合并相邻档位。单档净值不同于下方假设股价曲线的全组合总量。',gammaReading:'这些数据怎么读？',gammaCaveat:'GEX 依赖做市商持仓方向假设，不能确认真实库存。净正伽马下的对冲可能缓和波动，净负伽马可能放大两个方向的波动。正值越大可能增加双向缓冲，不只代表上涨阻力；曲线峰值不是价格上限。看涨墙／看跌墙是集中位置，不是保证有效的压力／支撑；零伽马也不是目标价。',comparisonHelp:'排除最近到期日用于观察剩余期限结构，不是到期后行情预测。两个快照可能分次查询，各自保留时间；曲线差异不等于真实资金流入流出。单位沿用供应商口径，未披露时不称美元／每1%。',gammaSource:'moomoo 伽马数据说明',gammaGuide:'图表与模型限制',painTitle:'最大痛苦 · 单个到期日',painIntro:'按所选到期日的 OI 结构，观察不同结算价格下的理论内在价值总额。',expiry:'到期日',painReading:'最大痛苦会变化吗？',painCaveat:'最大痛苦是固定到期日与 OI 快照下，合计期权到期内在价值最小的位置，不包含权利金，不是持有者真实盈亏，也不保证股价向它靠拢。它主要随 OI 更新而变化；固定 OI 下，股价上涨或下跌本身不会直接改变其计算值。',painDateHelp:'最大痛苦的单到期日与上方伽马的多期限范围独立。未披露 OI 结算日期时保持未知，不把查询时间当成结算日期。',painSource:'moomoo 最大痛苦数据说明',footer:'moomoo 供应商快照 · 遵循真实范围与数据时间 · 作为 PCR 的辅助参考。',loadingList:'正在读取关注名单和市场参考…',listFailed:'部分名单未能读取；只显示已成功读取的标的，可重新读取。',emptyList:'尚无可读取的标的，请检查连接或前往观察台添加。',listReady:'与关注名单和市场参考共用标的；此页不修改名单。',busy:'正在向 moomoo 检查…',reading:'正在读取保存的快照…',notLoaded:'尚无可用快照，点击更新检查 moomoo 数据。',current:'已读取供应商数据。各快照保留独立范围和时间。',partial:'部分数据缺失或检查失败；只展示已取得的数据，不补零。',failed:'检查未成功；已有快照保留原时间。',retained:'保留快照',cooldown:'{n} 秒后可更新',noRefresh:'当前访问模式不允许主动更新。',checked:'查询时间',updated:'供应商更新时间',unknown:'未披露',scopeDate:'范围基准日（美东）',expiries:'所含到期日',excluded:'排除到期日',callWall:'看涨墙',putWall:'看跌墙',zeroGamma:'零伽马',spot:'标的价格',noRemaining:'去掉最近到期日后，没有剩余到期日可比较。',filterLimit:'供应商对到期日过滤长度有限制，当前无法返回完整的排除最近到期日曲线；没有用单档柱子拼造总曲线。',missing:'暂无可用数据',profileMissing:'供应商尚未返回可用的总 GEX 曲线；墙位和行权价分布独立显示。',barsMissing:'该快照没有可用的行权价分布。',painMissing:'尚无可用的单到期日价值分布。',gexUnit:'模型 GEX · 供应商单位（未披露换算）',priceAxis:'假设标的价格',strikeAxis:'行权价',painAxis:'理论到期内在价值 · 供应商单位',call:'Call',put:'Put',net:'净值',total:'合计',dataTable:'查看图表数据',value:'数值',price:'价格',zerosNone:'未返回零点',snapshotStale:'这是保留的历史观察，不能当作当前期限范围的新检查。',expiryCount:'{n} 个到期日',painValue:'最大痛点',painExpiry:'实际到期日',oiDate:'OI 结算日：未披露',profileHint:'鼠标移动或聚焦图表后使用左右键查看数据。',noSourceTime:'查询时间不等于供应商数据更新时间；未披露时间保持未知。',sameScope:'当前范围只有最近到期日，排除后的曲线留空。',noContractExpiry:'未取得可选择的有效到期日。',modelOnly:'供应商模型估算，不是做市商真实持仓。'},
  en:{autoPrice:'Auto · Include walls and spot',autoPriceNote:'Auto keeps at least ±15% around snapshot spot and expands to disclosed spot, call wall and put wall levels; the aggregate GEX view also includes both snapshots’ zero-gamma points. A 5% margin is added on each side. This changes the view only, without recalculating GEX or inventing data outside the source range.',autoPriceFallback:'No usable positive spot or key level is available, so the chart shows all price points returned by the provider.',distributionAutoNote:'Auto includes this snapshot’s spot and call/put walls. Only the display range expands; strikes are not merged and no source data is invented.',distributionTitle:'Gamma distribution by strike',distributionIntro:'Green bars show Call, red bars Put, and grey diamonds each strike’s net contribution. Inspect concentrations and sparse areas beyond the two walls.',lineComparison:'Blue includes the selected expirations; dashed orange excludes the earliest selected expiry. At the same hypothetical spot, holding other model inputs constant, blue above orange implies a positive net contribution from that expiry, and below implies a negative one. Different snapshot times limit this to a structural comparison; orange is not a future price path.',settlementAxis:'Hypothetical settlement price at expiry',tableLimit:'The table shows the first 500 price points; the chart still uses all returned points.',permission:'Market-data permission is missing, or read-only authorization needs reconnecting.',unsupported:'The provider does not currently support this query.',notConfigured:'The moomoo read-only quote connection is not configured.',priceRange:'Chart price range',nearPrice:'Manual · Around snapshot spot ±15%',allPrice:'All prices',priceViewNote:'Only the chart view is cropped. Expiration scope and GEX are unchanged; level cards retain every returned level, while the independent data table shows up to 500 rows.',priceViewFallback:'Snapshot spot is undisclosed, so all prices are displayed.',outsideView:'No available point lies in this view. Choose All prices.',tableFull:'The table retains the full price range returned by the provider.',eyebrow:'Volatility context alongside PCR',title:'Gamma exposure & Max Pain',subtitle:'Check the expiration scope before reading exposure, walls and settlement structure.',selection:'Choose a symbol',symbol:'Watched symbol',reloadList:'Reload symbols',manage:'Manage watchlist',loadingHelp:'Opening this page reads saved snapshots only. Each Refresh button explicitly checks moomoo; full-day PCR is not refreshed.',gammaTitle:'Gamma exposure · With and without the nearest expiry',gammaIntro:'Compare the selected option portfolio and inspect strike-level contributions separately.',range:'Expiration scope',nearest:'Nearest expiry',seven:'Next 7 calendar days',thirty:'Next 30 calendar days',all:'All expirations',gammaRefresh:'Refresh Gamma',painRefresh:'Refresh Max Pain',profileTitle:'Aggregate GEX · Hypothetical underlying prices',profileHelp:'The horizontal axis is a hypothetical underlying price; the vertical axis is total portfolio model GEX. Above zero is model net positive gamma; below zero is net negative gamma. These curves are not price forecasts.',barsTitle:'Strike distribution · Snapshot',base:'Selected expirations',without:'Without nearest expiry',barsHelp:'The horizontal axis is strike, valued at the selected snapshot’s underlying price. Actual strike spacing is preserved; neighboring strikes are not merged. Each strike’s net contribution is distinct from the hypothetical-spot curve’s whole-portfolio value below.',gammaReading:'How should I read this?',gammaCaveat:'GEX depends on assumed dealer positioning and does not establish actual inventory. Positive-gamma hedging may dampen moves; negative gamma may amplify either direction. A larger positive value may strengthen two-way damping, not only resistance to rising prices; a curve peak is not a price ceiling. Call/put walls identify concentrations, not guaranteed resistance/support; zero gamma is not a price target.',comparisonHelp:'Excluding the nearest expiry shows remaining-term structure, not a forecast after expiration. Snapshots may be queried separately and retain their own times. Their difference is not observed capital flow. Units follow the provider; undisclosed normalization is not labeled dollars/per 1%.',gammaSource:'moomoo Gamma data reference',gammaGuide:'Chart methodology and limitations',painTitle:'Max Pain · One expiration',painIntro:'Inspect theoretical intrinsic value at expiry under different settlement prices, using the selected expiry’s OI structure.',expiry:'Expiration',painReading:'Does Max Pain change?',painCaveat:'Max Pain minimizes aggregate option intrinsic value at expiry for a fixed expiration and OI snapshot. It excludes premiums, is not holders’ actual profit/loss and does not guarantee price convergence. It mainly changes as OI updates; moving spot alone does not change the calculation with OI fixed.',painDateHelp:'The single Max Pain expiry is independent of the multi-expiry Gamma scope. An undisclosed OI settlement date remains unknown; retrieval time is not a settlement date.',painSource:'moomoo Max Pain data reference',footer:'moomoo provider snapshots · Actual scopes and source times · Context alongside PCR.',loadingList:'Loading the watchlist and market references…',listFailed:'Some symbol lists could not be read. Only successfully loaded symbols are shown; reload to retry.',emptyList:'No symbols are available. Check the connection or add symbols on PCR Watch.',listReady:'Uses symbols from your watchlist and market references; this page does not edit the lists.',busy:'Checking moomoo…',reading:'Reading saved snapshots…',notLoaded:'No usable snapshot is saved yet. Refresh to check moomoo.',current:'Provider data loaded. Each snapshot retains its own scope and timestamps.',partial:'Some data is missing or a check failed. Only available observations are shown; gaps are not zero.',failed:'The check did not succeed. Existing snapshots retain their original times.',retained:'Retained snapshot',cooldown:'Refresh in {n}s',noRefresh:'Explicit refresh is unavailable in this access mode.',checked:'Queried',updated:'Provider updated',unknown:'Undisclosed',scopeDate:'Scope reference date (New York)',expiries:'Included expirations',excluded:'Excluded expiry',callWall:'Call wall',putWall:'Put wall',zeroGamma:'Zero gamma',spot:'Underlying price',noRemaining:'No expiration remains after excluding the nearest expiry.',filterLimit:'The provider limits the expiration-filter length. A complete ex-nearest curve is unavailable; strike bars were not used to invent an aggregate curve.',missing:'No available data',profileMissing:'No usable aggregate GEX curve was returned. Walls and strike distributions are displayed independently.',barsMissing:'No usable strike distribution is available for this snapshot.',painMissing:'No usable value distribution is available for this expiry.',gexUnit:'Model GEX · Provider units (normalization undisclosed)',priceAxis:'Hypothetical underlying price',strikeAxis:'Strike',painAxis:'Theoretical intrinsic value at expiry · Provider units',call:'Call',put:'Put',net:'Net',total:'Total',dataTable:'View chart data',value:'Value',price:'Price',zerosNone:'No zero-gamma point returned',snapshotStale:'This is a retained historical observation, not a new check of the current expiration scope.',expiryCount:'{n} expirations',painValue:'Max Pain',painExpiry:'Actual expiration',oiDate:'OI settlement date: undisclosed',profileHint:'Move the pointer, or focus the chart and use the left/right arrow keys to inspect values.',noSourceTime:'Retrieval time is separate from provider data time; undisclosed times remain unknown.',sameScope:'The scope contains only the nearest expiry, so the ex-nearest curve is blank.',noContractExpiry:'No valid selectable expiration was retrieved.',modelOnly:'Provider model estimate, not observed dealer inventory.'}
};
